      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There was a mention in the Open Beta update for 1511.\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202433-openbeta\n\n> \"Improved reliability of blocking other users, as well as being invisible to each other (regardless of who blocked who).\"\n\nWill be interesting to see if the issue persist.",
